{"id":9219005513954,"title":"Barber's Blend Grooming Oil","handle":"barbers-blend-grooming-oil","description":"\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLegacy Reserve — Barber's Blend Grooming Oil\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eRooted in barbershop culture. Formulated with intention. Built for the man who holds himself to a standard.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eBarber's Blend is a dual-use hair and beard grooming oil crafted from active botanicals — zero fillers, zero shortcuts, zero compromise. Every ingredient in this formula was chosen because it performs. Nothing made the cut just to fill space.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThis is grooming elevated. A single formula that conditions, strengthens, and finishes — leaving hair and beard looking sharp and feeling healthy without the grease, without the buildup, and without the synthetic filler ingredients most brands hide behind.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat's Inside\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-pre-wrap leading-[1.7]\"\u003e◆ Active botanicals — every ingredient earns its place ◆ Dual-use formula — works for hair and beard ◆ Lightweight, non-greasy finish ◆ Signature scent accord — warm, masculine, refined ◆ Zero fillers. Zero synthetic padding. Zero compromise.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow to Use\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWarm 2–4 drops between your palms and work through damp or dry hair and beard. Style as usual. Use morning or night — or both.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Details\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e2 fl oz \/ 60ml — Crafted in Lafayette, Louisiana\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eTransitioning to our new 1oz format. Grab the 2oz Legacy Reserve at a founder's rate while supplies last.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-06-06T02:38:10-05:00","created_at":"2026-06-06T02:38:09-05:00","vendor":"Groomed Gent Co.","type":"","tags":[],"price":3000,"price_min":3000,"price_max":3000,"available":true,"price_varies":false,"compare_at_price":null,"compare_at_price_min":0,"compare_at_price_max":0,"compare_at_price_varies":false,"variants":[{"id":47865997230306,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"name":"Barber's Blend Grooming Oil","public_title":null,"options":["Default Title"],"price":3000,"weight":0,"compare_at_price":null,"inventory_management":null,"barcode":null,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"quantity_price_breaks":[],"requires_selling_plan":false,"selling_plan_allocations":[]}],"images":["\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0817\/6612\/1698\/files\/IMG-2400.png?v=1781985108"],"featured_image":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0817\/6612\/1698\/files\/IMG-2400.png?v=1781985108","options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}],"url":"\/products\/barbers-blend-grooming-oil","media":[{"alt":null,"id":38353828643042,"position":1,"preview_image":{"aspect_ratio":1.0,"height":1024,"width":1024,"src":"https: